{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/1794ba449b01b6c01ce5f3dea17fee64.avif?t=1762538515\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CENTRIFUGED is a choice-driven psychological RPG where you play a broken boy posing as a doctor to track down the cure for the girlfriend he left for dead. Step into a corrupt metropolis gripped by a mental plague, where unrest boils beneath every street and mind. Walk labyrinths of the human psyche, win or betray trust, heal the afflicted, and test the limits of your own morality \u2013 all while a parasitic voice inside you twists reality and threatens to destroy all you hold dear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/70fed38d1f505ab6053e380c8104214f.avif?t=1762538515\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dystopian Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the city\u2019s clinical daylight sterility to its pulsing nightlife, every corner holds hidden stories, dangers, and morally grey NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/013a99f6d97900f31cde8493b2fb5dcc.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/013a99f6d97900f31cde8493b2fb5dcc.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/013a99f6d97900f31cde8493b2fb5dcc.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Belief Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes Hunter\u2019s values and the city\u2019s perception of him. Your moral compass (or lack thereof) writes the story in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/f74db3d389806dad020e93a6da588c19.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/f74db3d389806dad020e93a6da588c19.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/f74db3d389806dad020e93a6da588c19.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heart Lake Mindscapes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside the psyches of the afflicted. Each Heart Lake Island is a surreal, adventure-packed dreamscape where shifting terrain and psychological bosses embody the patients' trauma. Cure their minds by conquering these living metaphors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/d60942deecc050389e258fe6bf47a112.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/d60942deecc050389e258fe6bf47a112.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/d60942deecc050389e258fe6bf47a112.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Role Playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build alliances or burn bridges. Relationships with fellow doctors and citizens alike unlock secrets and drive the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/696e946d83389ed76c4e9a42cb534b4c.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/696e946d83389ed76c4e9a42cb534b4c.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/696e946d83389ed76c4e9a42cb534b4c.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stress &amp; Leech</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your inner parasite is always waiting in the wings. Let your stress spiral and Leech can seize control, twisting your actions and the narrative beyond your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/84fc403ddf9ced30e57cd776e4ee29c6.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/84fc403ddf9ced30e57cd776e4ee29c6.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/84fc403ddf9ced30e57cd776e4ee29c6.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mindwalking &amp; Verbal Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat fractured patients through dialogue that cuts like a scalpel. Each question carves a path toward hidden anguish and unthinkable diagnoses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/b8151d90a9b8a16332d07a977caf246b.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/b8151d90a9b8a16332d07a977caf246b.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/b8151d90a9b8a16332d07a977caf246b.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings &amp; High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run reflects the person you become: savior or monster, healer or destroyer. New paths and new identities await every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/5d39dd2260f715cef17b947f1e0e1c9e.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/5d39dd2260f715cef17b947f1e0e1c9e.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/5d39dd2260f715cef17b947f1e0e1c9e.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, atmospheric narrative that shifts from cold clinical precision to lurid affairs, pulling you deeper into a city where morality and madness blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/ed0b9673785f4495197065a219b15989.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/ed0b9673785f4495197065a219b15989.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/ed0b9673785f4495197065a219b15989.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Score &amp; Sound Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmosphere shaped by our in-house composer. From hushed, haunting motifs to swelling city soundscapes, every note deepens the tension and turns Centrifuged City into a living, breathing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/ff1b3fa3d5f0e29187db38df0a0abdd8.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/ff1b3fa3d5f0e29187db38df0a0abdd8.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/ff1b3fa3d5f0e29187db38df0a0abdd8.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/15ea2a0f739b1210dd4c9b0b07c5f5a6.avif?t=1762538515\" width=1560 height=324 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4148160?t=1762538515","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/b93b228ba60fbfe5caf96907ec879186faae7ffc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762538515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/ba05eb6dd70c3822a16895875832c9c27b9ae502/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762538515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/ba05eb6dd70c3822a16895875832c9c27b9ae502/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762538515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/1794ba449b01b6c01ce5f3dea17fee64.avif?t=1762538515\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CENTRIFUGED is a choice-driven psychological RPG where you play a broken boy posing as a doctor to track down the cure for the girlfriend he left for dead. Step into a corrupt metropolis gripped by a mental plague, where unrest boils beneath every street and mind. Walk labyrinths of the human psyche, win or betray trust, heal the afflicted, and test the limits of your own morality \u2013 all while a parasitic voice inside you twists reality and threatens to destroy all you hold dear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/70fed38d1f505ab6053e380c8104214f.avif?t=1762538515\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dystopian Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the city\u2019s clinical daylight sterility to its pulsing nightlife, every corner holds hidden stories, dangers, and morally grey NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/013a99f6d97900f31cde8493b2fb5dcc.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/013a99f6d97900f31cde8493b2fb5dcc.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https