\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Role Playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build alliances or burn bridges. Relationships with fellow doctors and citizens alike unlock secrets and drive the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/696e946d83389ed76c4e9a42cb534b4c.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/696e946d83389ed76c4e9a42cb534b4c.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/696e946d83389ed76c4e9a42cb534b4c.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stress &amp; Leech</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your inner parasite is always waiting in the wings. Let your stress spiral and Leech can seize control, twisting your actions and the narrative beyond your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/84fc403ddf9ced30e57cd776e4ee29c6.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/84fc403ddf9ced30e57cd776e4ee29c6.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/84fc403ddf9ced30e57cd776e4ee29c6.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mindwalking &amp; Verbal Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat fractured patients through dialogue that cuts like a scalpel. Each question carves a path toward hidden anguish and unthinkable diagnoses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/b8151d90a9b8a16332d07a977caf246b.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/b8151d90a9b8a16332d07a977caf246b.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/b8151d90a9b8a16332d07a977caf246b.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings &amp; High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run reflects the person you become: savior or monster, healer or destroyer. New paths and new identities await every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/5d39dd2260f715cef17b947f1e0e1c9e.poster.avif?t=1762538515\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/5d39dd2260f715cef17b947f1e0e1c9e.webm?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148160/extras/5d39dd2260f715cef17b947f1e0e1c9e.mp4?t=1762538515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, atmospheric narrative that shifts from cold clinical precision to lurid affairs, pulling you deeper into a city where morality and madness blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s